  "ST_CUTstart_Variations": {
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGame_1_1": " What better time than the 90s, right? Good lord, in heaven.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGame_6_1": "Eve-ry-body wants to wear the crown, right? �Question is: who are you willing to be - to fuckin get it?",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGameHielo_1_1": "First I thought it was a joke - my big competition in the pill-business - was this candy-ass? Party-boy, clown - shakin his dick in every camera pointed his way. Tell you what, though - looks can be goddamn deceiving. ",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGame_3_1": "Fuck, man - I was goddamn handsome - back when I moseyed into Rockay. Fixin to take the whole town by storm.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGameGloves_1_1": "I was just a kid, first time I got popped. It was for stealing candy - funny enough. Since then - me and fuckin cops, we don�t get along so good. But in order to dodge Johnny law, you gotta think like Johnny law. Enter - ex-cop by the name of Gloves - clean hands, cop�s brain, and some bad habits.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGameTouchdown_1_1": "If you�re lucky - you got a bruiser on your bench who'll go the distance for you. An old-school, hard-nosed buddy, who you came up with - so you know you can goddamn trust him. And if you�re real goddamn lucky, the fucker's gutsy enough to storm the field with the troops - and take it all.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGame_4_1": "Live fast, die young - leave a good lookin corpse, right? ",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGameCasey_1_1": "Mmm mmm mmm - Casey, Casey, Casey� two little letters never packed so much goddamn heat. Being a greenhorn in Rockay, I needed someone hooked-up, help get my candy-shop up and runnin. And good-ol Casey ain�t nothin - if she ain�t well-fuckin-connected. ",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGameGloves_2_1": "Nasara - the man behind the man. Can�t hold a big-time operation without a strong right-hand. This one �washed up on the fuckin beach -  but that�s good - cause in this racket - sometimes you need a jellyfish - and sometimes you need� a shark.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGameDDragon_1_1": "Number one, Grade-A, world-class pain in my fuckin balls - The Dollar Dragon. The King�s Right Hand -fuckin reptile, got his slimy-scales all over Rockay. Cold-blooded for sure - but that fucker breathes fire.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGameCagnali_1_1": "Ohhh - Cagnali - now she's a real piece of work. Queen Cunt of Bitch Island. Turns out she�s a doctor, actually - far as I can tell, her specialty is chopping balls off and eatin �em for lunch.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGame_2_1": "Rockay City - wow - what�d they used to call it? The Crown Jewel of Florida�  � got the crown part right. ",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGameLt_1_1": "Sheriff�s got a little butt-buddy, they call him LT. Thinks he's Sonny fuckin Crockett. Local boy-scout who shot to the top of the pig-farm - after the brass got wiped out.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGameOldKing_1_1": "The Old King� I gotta hand it to him: he�s held Rockay - with a fuckin iron grip. Cops on the take, Mayor in his pocket, Dragon as his right-hand, sum-bitch made this town into a criminal�s paradise - but old King�s grow weak - and this guy? He�s a goddamn dinosaur. �",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGameKhan_1_1": "They say about half-a-percent of everybody on the fuckin planet has the blood of goddamn Genghis Khan runnin though their veins. Well - this fuckin lunatic�s got even more than that - and he wants to go down in history - as the sole-conquerer of Rockay.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTstart_StartGame_5_1": "To get what you want - you gotta figure out who you�re willin to throw-down against. Battle for the King of Rockay meant goin toe-to-toe with the baddest ass-kicker on the planet - Sheriff Goddamn Chuck Fuckin Norris. "
  },
